{"__inputs":[{"name":"DS_VICTORIAMETRICS","label":"VictoriaMetrics","type":"datasource","pluginId":"prometheus"}],"__requires":[{"type":"grafana","id":"grafana","name":"Grafana","version":"12.0.0"},{"type":"datasource","id":"prometheus","name":"Prometheus","version":"1.0.0"},{"type":"panel","id":"stat","name":"Stat","version":""},{"type":"panel","id":"timeseries","name":"Time series","version":""},{"type":"panel","id":"bargauge","name":"Bar gauge","version":""},{"type":"panel","id":"text","name":"Text","version":""}],"uid":"copilot-otel-token-economics","title":"Copilot \u2014 Token Usage and Model Economics","description":"Enterprise token consumption by model from VS OTel. Metric names use dots as stored natively in VictoriaMetrics.","tags":["copilot","otel","tokens","model"],"timezone":"browser","schemaVersion":39,"version":1,"refresh":"1h","time":{"from":"now-28d","to":"now"},"graphTooltip":1,"templating":{"list":[{"name":"service","type":"query","datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},"query":"label_values({\"gen_ai.client.token.usage_count\"}, service_name)","refresh":2,"multi":true,"includeAll":true,"allValue":".*","label":"Service","current":{},"options":[]},{"name":"model","type":"query","datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},"query":"label_values({\"gen_ai.client.token.usage_count\"}, \"gen_ai.request.model\")","refresh":2,"multi":true,"includeAll":true,"allValue":".*","label":"Model","current":{},"options":[]}]},"panels":[{"id":1,"type":"text","title":"About This Dashboard","gridPos":{"h":5,"w":24,"x":0,"y":0},"options":{"mode":"markdown","content":"## Copilot Token Usage and Model Economics\n\nEnterprise-wide token consumption from Visual Studio OTel instrumentation. Shows which models are most token-intensive and how consumption trends over time.\n\n**Metric names use dots** e.g. `gen_ai.client.token.usage_sum` \u2014 stored natively in VictoriaMetrics without underscore conversion.\n\n**Service filter:** `copilot-chat` = chat panel and agent mode. `github-copilot` = inline completions.\n\n**Token types:** `input` = tokens sent to the model (prompt + context). `output` = tokens generated by the model (response).\n\n**Note:** No user_login label on these metrics \u2014 enterprise totals only."}},{"id":100,"type":"row","title":"Token Summary","gridPos":{"h":1,"w":24,"x":0,"y":5},"collapsed":false},{"id":2,"type":"stat","title":"Total Input Tokens","description":"Total input tokens sent to all models in the selected window. Source: gen_ai.client.token.usage_sum filtered to gen_ai.token.type=input.","gridPos":{"h":4,"w":6,"x":0,"y":6},"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},"targets":[{"expr":"sum(increase({\"gen_ai.client.token.usage_sum\", \"gen_ai.token.type\"=\"input\", service_name=~\"$service\"}[$__range]))","legendFormat":"Total Input Tokens","refId":"A"}],"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"color":{"mode":"fixed","fixedColor":"#3B82E6"},"unit":"locale","decimals":0}},"options":{"reduceOptions":{"calcs":["lastNotNull"]},"colorMode":"background","graphMode":"none","textMode":"value_and_name"}},{"id":3,"type":"stat","title":"Total Output Tokens","description":"Total output tokens generated by all models. Source: gen_ai.client.token.usage_sum filtered to gen_ai.token.type=output.","gridPos":{"h":4,"w":6,"x":6,"y":6},"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},"targets":[{"expr":"sum(increase({\"gen_ai.client.token.usage_sum\", \"gen_ai.token.type\"=\"output\", service_name=~\"$service\"}[$__range]))","legendFormat":"Total Output Tokens","refId":"A"}],"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"color":{"mode":"fixed","fixedColor":"#5BA85B"},"unit":"locale","decimals":0}},"options":{"reduceOptions":{"calcs":["lastNotNull"]},"colorMode":"background","graphMode":"none","textMode":"value_and_name"}},{"id":4,"type":"stat","title":"Total Operations","description":"Total LLM operations (prompt-response cycles). Source: gen_ai.client.operation.duration_count.","gridPos":{"h":4,"w":6,"x":12,"y":6},"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},"targets":[{"expr":"sum(increase({\"gen_ai.client.operation.duration_count\", service_name=~\"$service\"}[$__range]))","legendFormat":"Total Operations","refId":"A"}],"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"color":{"mode":"fixed","fixedColor":"#9C5FE0"},"unit":"locale","decimals":0}},"options":{"reduceOptions":{"calcs":["lastNotNull"]},"colorMode":"background","graphMode":"none","textMode":"value_and_name"}},{"id":5,"type":"stat","title":"Avg Tokens per Operation","description":"Average total tokens (input + output) per LLM operation. Rising values indicate increasingly complex prompts.","gridPos":{"h":4,"w":6,"x":18,"y":6},"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},"targets":[{"expr":"sum(increase({\"gen_ai.client.token.usage_sum\", service_name=~\"$service\"}[$__range])) / clamp_min(sum(increase({\"gen_ai.client.operation.duration_count\", service_name=~\"$service\"}[$__range])), 1)","legendFormat":"Avg Tokens per Operation","refId":"A"}],"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"color":{"mode":"fixed","fixedColor":"#F0954A"},"unit":"locale","decimals":1}},"options":{"reduceOptions":{"calcs":["lastNotNull"]},"colorMode":"background","graphMode":"none","textMode":"value_and_name"}},{"id":101,"type":"row","title":"Token Trends","gridPos":{"h":1,"w":24,"x":0,"y":10},"collapsed":false},{"id":6,"type":"timeseries","title":"Daily Token Consumption \u2014 Input vs Output","description":"Daily input and output token consumption. Input tokens dominate cost on most models.","gridPos":{"h":9,"w":24,"x":0,"y":11},"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},"targets":[{"expr":"sum(increase({\"gen_ai.client.token.usage_sum\", \"gen_ai.token.type\"=\"input\", service_name=~\"$service\"}[1d]))","legendFormat":"Input Tokens","refId":"A"},{"expr":"sum(increase({\"gen_ai.client.token.usage_sum\", \"gen_ai.token.type\"=\"output\", service_name=~\"$service\"}[1d]))","legendFormat":"Output Tokens","refId":"B"}],"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"unit":"locale","custom":{"fillOpacity":75,"lineWidth":2}},"overrides":[{"matcher":{"id":"byName","options":"Input Tokens"},"properties":[{"id":"color","value":{"mode":"fixed","fixedColor":"#3B82E6"}}]},{"matcher":{"id":"byName","options":"Output Tokens"},"properties":[{"id":"color","value":{"mode":"fixed","fixedColor":"#5BA85B"}}]}]},"options":{"legend":{"displayMode":"list","placement":"bottom"},"tooltip":{"mode":"multi"}}},{"id":7,"type":"timeseries","title":"Daily Token Consumption by Service","description":"Token split between copilot-chat and github-copilot (completions).","gridPos":{"h":9,"w":12,"x":0,"y":20},"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},"targets":[{"expr":"sum by (service_name) (increase({\"gen_ai.client.token.usage_sum\"}[1d]))","legendFormat":"{{service_name}}","refId":"A"}],"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"unit":"locale","custom":{"fillOpacity":75,"lineWidth":2}}},"options":{"legend":{"displayMode":"list","placement":"bottom"},"tooltip":{"mode":"multi"}}},{"id":8,"type":"timeseries","title":"Avg Tokens per Operation Over Time","description":"Rolling average tokens per LLM operation. Rising trend = more complex prompts or larger context windows.","gridPos":{"h":9,"w":12,"x":12,"y":20},"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},"targets":[{"expr":"sum(rate({\"gen_ai.client.token.usage_sum\", service_name=~\"$service\"}[1d])) / clamp_min(sum(rate({\"gen_ai.client.operation.duration_count\", service_name=~\"$service\"}[1d])), 0.001)","legendFormat":"Avg Tokens/Op","refId":"A"}],"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"unit":"locale","decimals":1,"color":{"mode":"fixed","fixedColor":"#F0954A"},"custom":{"fillOpacity":75,"lineWidth":2}}},"options":{"legend":{"displayMode":"list","placement":"bottom"},"tooltip":{"mode":"single"}}},{"id":102,"type":"row","title":"Token Usage by Model","gridPos":{"h":1,"w":24,"x":0,"y":29},"collapsed":false},{"i